# Architecture Decision Records

See `docs/adr/README.md`.

## When to Create an ADR

- New package or architectural layer
- Technology choice over a realistic alternative
- Reversal or revision of an existing decision
- New cross-cutting convention (pagination, result pattern, naming)

## Process

1. Copy `docs/adr/0000-template.md` → `docs/adr/NNNN-title.md`
2. Include ADR in the **same PR** as the change
3. Update `docs/adr/README.md` index
4. Never delete merged ADRs — supersede only

## Do NOT Create ADRs For

Routine features, UI tweaks, bug fixes, config changes.
